 "title": "Osborne County Treasurer",
 "text": "Osborne County Treasurer\nDepartments\nAppraiser\nCounty Attorney\nCounty Clerk\nCommissioners\nElections\nEmergency Management\nExtension Office\nHealth Department\nHighway Department\nNoxious Weeds\nOsborne Rural Fire Districts\nRecycling\nRegister Of Deeds\nSanitary Landfill\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nPartnerships\nConservation District\nDane G Hansen Foundation\nDistrict Court\nEmergency Medical Services\nOsborne County Community Foundation\nOsborne County Leadership\nNews & Information\nBio-Terrorism -->\nCalendar -->\nCounty Links\nDocuments\nE-Waste\nHistory\nJob Opportunities\nLevies\nMaps\nNews\nOpen Record Information\nText Osborne County\nVeterans Register\nAppraisal Search -->\nAppraisal Search\nLicense Tag & Property Tax\nMonday - Friday\n8:30 a.m. - 12:00 Noon\n& 1:00 p.m. - 5:00 p.m.\nDriver's License Renewals\nMonday - Friday\n8:30 a.m. - 12:00 Noon\n& 1:00 - 4:00 p.m.\nAfter 4:00 p.m. by appointment\nThe Osborne County Treasurer's Office has a position for a Tax/Motor Vehicle clerk. Duties will include but are not limited to; processing vehicle titles, data entry, working directly with the public and assisting the Treasurer in daily office tasks.\n-->\nRequirements include a high school diploma or equivalent, some computer knowledge and being able to travel for classes. Any question or to receive an application please call or stop by the Osborne County Treasurer's Office. If any questions please call 785-346-2251. Position open until filled. EOE.\n-->\nOsborne County Treasurer\nBobbi Jo Boxum\n423 West Main Street\nPO Box 160\nOsborne, KS 67473-0160\nPhone: 785-346-2251\nFax: 785-346-5252\nobcotreas@osbornecounty.gov\nemail BobbiJo\nAngela Befort, Deputy\nobcodmv@osbornecounty.gov\nemail Angela\nBecky Hager\nobcodmv2@osbornecounty.gov\nemail\nTreasurer Pages...\nMotor Vehicle Tax Estimator -->\nMotor Vehicle Tax Estimator\nDriver's License\nLinks\nNeighborhood Revitalization Forms\nProperty Tax\nTax Foreclosure Sale\nVehicle Tags\n&placement=left&parentOrigin=https://osbornecounty.org&mobile=0\" style=\"width: 255px; height: 276.484px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; position: fixed; right: unset; left: 0px; bottom: 60px; z-index: 10000;\">",
